00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.000
Significa integrare

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.000
la sicurezza dei contenuti

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:46.640
in ogni pipeline.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:47.840
Significa usare

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:48.440
l'osservabilità

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:48.860
